From c2d8f53baf8298824e9d8a3fdc78ece2b7c5126d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 20:02:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(action-service): require bearer-bound principals; ignore
 x-aion-role

Close the Finding 4 auth boundary: all /v1 routes fail closed without a
server-mapped Authorization bearer. Client role headers no longer elevate
permissions. Adds regression tests and documents Core/Runtime as the only
side-effect authority (AIO-106).
